<title>JAPAN: Uruguay launches 10 bln yen 5-year samurai - Nikko.</title>
<headline>Uruguay launches 10 bln yen 5-year samurai - Nikko.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following samurai bond issue was announced by lead-manager Nikko Securities on Tuesday:</p>
<p> BORROWER	  Republic of Uruguay</p>
<p> AMT		 10 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON	    2.5 pct</p>
<p> MATURITY	  24 April 2002</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 99.90</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  24 April 1997</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	April 18 to April 23</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     NIS BBB-</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Nikko Securities</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8785</p>
</text>
